    "text": "By Brett Vito Staff Writer ,\n1 days ago Grayson O’Bara always toed the line during his days as a standout wide receiver at Guyer High School. That’s just who O’Bara is. Focusing on doing everything he was supposed to — and doing it to the best of his ability — is how he became an elite player for one of the top programs in the state, not to mention an excellent student who carried a 4.2 GPA in his senior year of high school. Read full article",
